cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use MYCELIUM-Accel in your research, please cite it using
  this metadata.
title: MYCELIUM-Accel
type: software
version: 1.5.0
date-released: "2026-09-10"
authors:
  - name: MYCELIUM-Accel contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/INSIRA-ORGAO/mycelium-accel"
abstract: >-
  Paired-statistics acceleration harness for arbitrary projects (Python,
  C/CMake, Rust/Cargo, Node). No LLM in any stage, prime-seed validation,
  sandboxed variant application with snapshot/rollback and kill-switch, and
  accept/reject decisions gated by paired per-seed statistics (BCa bootstrap
  confidence intervals, sign-flip permutation, Holm/BH correction) with
  honest negative results.
keywords:
  - benchmarking
  - statistics
  - optimization
  - performance
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
